sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as Main Render Loop 60 FPS
    participant FCC as FlightControlComputer
    participant DDS as DDS Publish Thread 20 Hz
    participant Broker as eProsima Broker

    Main ->> FCC: step(pilot_input, dt)
    Note over FCC: Control Law + Actuators<br/>F16AeroFM + EOM 6-DOF RK4
    FCC ->> FCC: m_state aggiornato, packet_id++

    par Render loop e DDS thread in parallelo
        loop Ogni 50ms (20 Hz)
            DDS ->> FCC: get_state()
            FCC -->> DDS: FlightState snapshot
            DDS ->> FCC: get_actuator_state()
            FCC -->> DDS: ActuatorOut snapshot
            DDS ->> DDS: Popola F16Kinematics
            DDS ->> DDS: Popola F16AeroState
            DDS ->> DDS: Popola F16Actuators
            DDS ->> Broker: write(F16KinematicsTopic)
            Broker -->> DDS: ack RELIABLE
            DDS ->> Broker: write(F16AeroStateTopic)
            Broker -->> DDS: ack RELIABLE
            DDS ->> Broker: write(F16ActuatorsTopic)
            Broker -->> DDS: ack RELIABLE
            DDS ->> DDS: sleep 50ms
        end
    and
        Main ->> Main: populate_plane_data()
        Main ->> FCC: get_state()
        FCC -->> Main: FlightState
        Main ->> Main: display.Draw(PlaneData)
    end
